35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often empty or dirty when I get it. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple the work of Tuesdays. It is uneven.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are high, but the fuel is split very unevenly.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,The other groups failed because they had to ask favours constantly.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two of us bought most of the fuel. The heavy weeks were brutal.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if two of you drive most, why do I pay the same?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, because the arranging time is also a cost. I lose evenings.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, time is money, but we need a system that accounts for it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, a system that requires asking favours will fail. We know that now.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I agree. We need a way that doesn't feel like begging.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need my weekly trips to be guaranteed. They keep collapsing.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,"I need the cost to reflect the actual distance, not just a flat fee.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,A flat fee ignores the heavy users. It subsidises the light users.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"If we use a calendar, we don't have to ask. We just book.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,A calendar with distance tracking sounds fair. It uses the real data.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
